  "title": "Plexus Announces Fiscal Second Quarter Financial Results",
  "summary": "NEENAH, WI, April 29, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Plexus Corp. (NASDAQ: PLXS) today announced financial results for our fiscal second quarter ended April 4, 2026, and guidance for our fiscal third quarter ending July 4, 2026. Reports record fiscal second quarter 2026 revenue of $1.164 billion, GAAP operating margin of 5.3% and GAAP diluted EPS of $1.82. Reports fiscal second quarter 2026 non-GAAP operating margin of 6.0% and non-GAAP diluted EPS of $2.05, excluding $0.23 of stock-based compensation",
